{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2022-08-23 12:00:00', 'title': 'ADP RESEARCH INSTITUTE AND STANFORD DIGITAL ECONOMY LAB UNVEIL NEW METHODOLOGY FOR ADP NATIONAL EMPLOYMENT REPORT', 'text': 'NEW DATA SERIES WILL SERVE AS INDEPENDENT INDICATOR OF U.S. WORKFORCE AND FEATURE HIGH-FREQUENCY JOBS AND PAY DATA; FIRST REPORT AVAILABLE AUGUST 31 ROSELAND, N.J. , AUG. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ADP RESEARCH INSTITUTE (ADPRI) AND THE STANFORD DIGITAL ECONOMY LAB (THE LAB) HAVE DEVELOPED A NEW METHODOLOGY FOR THE ADP NATIONAL EMPLOYMENT REPORT (NER) THAT WILL PROVIDE A MORE ROBUST, HIGH-FREQUENCY VIEW OF THE LABOR MARKET WITH A FOCUS ON BOTH JOBS AND PAY.'}